  "sections": [
    {
      "kind": "prose",
      "heading": "What This Service Involves",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "html": "We carry out a full, manufacturer-aligned repair of the valve-seal and coolant systems on your Mercedes-AMG V8 engine. The process includes:"
        },
        {
          "t": "ul",
          "items": [
            "**Valve-seal replacement** - precise removal of valve gear, camshaft locking, and fitting of new seals using correct tooling.",
            "**Coolant-system diagnostic & overhaul** - full pressure test, replacement of worn seals, hoses, thermostat housings, and correct bleed procedure.",
            "**Reassembly with new consumables** - every job uses new aluminium torque-to-yield bolts and OE-spec anaerobic sealant where required (e.g. M157/M178 valve covers).",
            "**Final validation** - road test and thermal cycle check to confirm leak-free operation and correct coolant flow."
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "html": "This is a workshop-based repair - your vehicle is collected, repaired, and returned with a 12-month unlimited-mileage warranty."
        }
      ]
    },
